# Supply chain: npm refuses package versions that were published less than 7 days ago
# (npm >= 11.x). Dependabot waits the same 7 days (.github/dependabot.yml, cooldown).
# A freshly published release is the most likely to be hijacked or broken; both are
# usually found and pulled within days. `npm ci` installs exactly what the lockfile
# says and is not affected. tests/supply-chain.test.ts pins this file.
min-release-age=7
